<h2>Booking Confirmed! 🎉</h2>

<p>Hello <%= @customer.user.full_name %>,</p>

<p>Great news! Your booking with <strong><%= @vendor.business_name %></strong> for <strong><%= @service.name %></strong> has been confirmed.</p>

<div class="details-card">
  <h3>Confirmed Booking Details</h3>
  <ul class="details-list">
    <li><strong>Service:</strong> <%= @service.name %></li>
    <li><strong>Vendor:</strong> <%= @vendor.business_name %></li>
    <li><strong>Date & Time:</strong> <%= format_booking_time(@booking) %></li>
    <li><strong>Duration:</strong> <%= time_duration(@booking.event_date, @booking.event_end_date || @booking.event_date + 2.hours) %></li>
    <li><strong>Location:</strong> <%= @booking.event_location %></li>
    <li><strong>Contact Email:</strong> <%= @vendor.user.email %></li>
    <% if @vendor.phone.present? %>
      <li><strong>Contact Phone:</strong> <%= @vendor.phone %></li>
    <% end %>
    <li><strong>Total Amount:</strong> ₹<%= number_with_precision(@booking.total_amount, precision: 2) %></li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="button-container">
  <a href="<%= @view_booking_url %>" class="button">View Booking in Dashboard</a>
</div>

<p style="margin-top: 24px;">We'll send you a reminder 24 hours before your event. If you need to make any changes, you can message the vendor directly through your dashboard.</p>

<p>Best regards,<br>
<strong>The Ayoj Team</strong></p>